names>OR</given-names></name><name><surname>Erdi</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Venkatraman</surname><given-names>ES</given-names></name><name><surname>Scher</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A new parameter for measuring metastatic bone involvement by prostate cancer: the bone scan index</article-title><source>Clin Cancer Res</source><year>1998</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>1765</fpage><lpage>1772</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Clin Cancer Res||4|1765||bib11|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9676853</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Noguchi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Noda</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Pyridinoline cross-linked carboxyterminal telopeptide of type I collagen as a useful marker for monitoring metastatic bone activity in men with prostate cancer</article-title><source>J Urol</source><year>2001</year><volume>166</volume><fpage>1106</fpage><lpage>1110</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Urol||166|1106||bib13|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11490307</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rana</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Chisholm</surname><given-names>GD</given-names></name><name><surname>Khan</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Sekharjit</surname><given-names>SS</given-names></name><name><surname>Merrik</surname><given-names>MV</given-names></name><name><surname>Elton</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Patterns of bone metastasis and their prognostic significance in patients with carcinoma of the prostate</article-title><source>Brit J Urol</source><year>1993</year><volume>72</volume><fpage>933</fpage><lpage>936</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Brit J Urol||72|933||bib14|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8306158</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Risteli</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Elomana</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Niemi</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Novamo</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Risteli</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Radioimmunoassay for the pyridinoline cross-linked carboxyterminal telopeptide of type I collagen: a new serum marker of bone collagen degradation</article-title><source>Clin Chem</source><year>1993</year><volume>39</volume><fpage>635</fpage><lpage>640</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Clin Chem||39|635||bib15|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8472358</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Scabbatini</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Larson</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name><name><surname>Kremer</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Zhang</surname><given-names>ZF</given-names></name><name><surname>Sun</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Yeung</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Imbriaco</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Horak</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Conolly</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Ding</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Ouyang</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Kelly</surname><given-names>WK</given-names></name><name><surname>Scher</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prognostic significance of extent of disease in bone in patients with androgen-independent prostate cancer</article-title><source>J Clin Oncol</source><year>1999</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>948</fpage><lpage>957</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Clin Oncol||17|948||bib16|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10071289</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Schaffer</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name><name><surname>Pendergrass</surname><given-names>HP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Comparison of enzyme, clinical, radiographic, and radionuclide methods of detecting bone metastases from carcinoma of the prostate</article-title><source>Radiology</source><year>1976</year><volume>121</volume><fpage>431</fpage><lpage>434</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Radiology||121|431||bib17|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">981622</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Soloway</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name><name><surname>Hardeman</surname><given-names>SW</given-names></name><name><surname>Hickey</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Raymond</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Todd</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Soloway</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Moinuddin</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Stratification of patients with metastatic prostate cancer based on extent of disease on initial scan</article-title><source>Cancer</source><year>1988</year><volume>61</volume><fpage>195</fpage><lpage>202</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer||61|195||bib18|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3334948</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>